flowchart LR
    UI[Streamlit UI] --> T[Ticket agent]
    T --> L[Log agent]
    L --> P[Investigation planner]
    P -->|Retrieval not needed| D[Root-cause agent]
    P -->|Retrieval needed| R[RAG agent]
    R --> E[Retrieval evaluator]
    E -->|Sufficient| D
    E -->|Insufficient, attempt 1| F[Refine query]
    F --> R
    E -->|Insufficient, attempt 2| D
    D --> A[Recommendation agent]
    A --> P[RCA report agent]
    P --> H{Human review}
    H -->|Approve| E[End]
    H -->|Revise| E
    H -->|Cancel| E

    R -.-> C[(ChromaDB knowledge base)]

    T -.-> M[LLM factory]
    L -.-> M
    D -.-> M
    A -.-> M
    P -.-> M
    M --> O[OpenAI]
    M --> Q[Ollama / local Llama]

    S[SupportTroubleshootingState\nTypedDict] -. shared state .-> T
    S -. shared state .-> L
    S -. shared state .-> R
    S -. shared state .-> D
    S -. shared state .-> A
    S -. shared state .-> P
    S -. shared state .-> H
